          %h3#RelationToUnreducedCohomology Relation to unreduced cohomology
          %p
            For an unreduced
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohomology+theory"} cohomology theory
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi E
                    %mo •
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E^\bullet
            the induced
            %strong reduced cohomology
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/kernel"} kernel
            of operation of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback+in+cohomology"} pullback
            to the base point.
          .maruku-equation
